# Component Library First

This project uses **shadcn/ui** (`components/ui/`). Always reach for these before writing custom JSX primitives.

## Installed components

`Alert` · `Badge` · `Button` · `Card` · `Command` · `Dialog` · `DropdownMenu` · `Input` · `InputGroup` · `Label` · `Progress` · `Select` · `Separator` · `Sheet` · `Skeleton` · `Table` · `Tabs` · `Textarea` · `Tooltip`

## Rules

### ❌ Never build these from scratch — use shadcn

```tsx
// ❌ raw <select>
<select className="..." onChange={...}>...</select>

// ✅ shadcn Select
import { Select, SelectTrigger, SelectValue, SelectContent, SelectItem } from "@/components/ui/select";
<Select value={value} onValueChange={setValue}>
  <SelectTrigger><SelectValue placeholder="All tables" /></SelectTrigger>
  <SelectContent>{items.map(i => <SelectItem key={i} value={i}>{i}</SelectItem>)}</SelectContent>
</Select>
```

```tsx
// ❌ raw <table>/<thead>/<tbody>/<tr>/<td>
<table><thead><tr><th>...</th></tr></thead><tbody>...</tbody></table>

// ✅ shadcn Table
import { Table, TableHeader, TableRow, TableHead, TableBody, TableCell } from "@/components/ui/table";
```

```tsx
// ❌ local inline tab navigation
function TabLink({ href, active }) { return <a className={active ? "border-b-2..." : "..."}>...</a> }

// ✅ shadcn Tabs
import { Tabs, TabsList, TabsTrigger, TabsContent } from "@/components/ui/tabs";
```

```tsx
// ❌ inline colored <span> as a badge
<span style={{ color, background }}>CREATE</span>

// ✅ shadcn Badge
import { Badge } from "@/components/ui/badge";
<Badge variant="outline">CREATE</Badge>
```

```tsx
// ❌ custom alert banner div
<div role="alert" style={{ backgroundColor: "..." }}>...</div>

// ✅ shadcn Alert
import { Alert, AlertDescription } from "@/components/ui/alert";
<Alert variant="destructive"><AlertDescription>...</AlertDescription></Alert>
```

### Stat / metric cards — use MetricCard

The shared component is `components/dashboard/metric-card.tsx`. It supports `icon`, `iconColor`, `valueColor`, `sub`, `tooltip`, `delta`, and `loading`.

```tsx
// ❌ local StatCard defined inside a page file
function StatCard({ label, value, ... }) { ... }

// ✅ import MetricCard
import MetricCard from "@/components/dashboard/metric-card";
<MetricCard label="Total Flows" value={n} icon={FileText} iconColor="var(--ci-interactive)" />
```

### When a custom component IS appropriate

Only build a new component when:
- The needed pattern genuinely doesn't exist in shadcn (e.g., `RiskSummaryBar` with severity-coded accent bars)
- The component composes multiple shadcn primitives into a domain-specific widget
- Place it in `components/<domain>/` — never inline inside a page file
